   <title>3 years on, Morocco earthquake victims still wait for help</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/3-years-on-morocco-earthquake-victims-still-wait-for-help/a-78874844?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss</link>
